VALUES ('Products', 'Manufacturer', 'Protoshape Precision Engineering', 'Specialist plastic injection mould toolmaker and moulder established in 2011 in Linlithgow, West Lothian, Scotland, offering plastic part design, precision toolmaking, and injection moulding under one roof. Led by a toolmaker with over 30 years of industry experience, Protoshape manufactures moulds in P20 tool steel and tooling-grade aluminium using Haas machining centres and Charmilles EDM machines.', '{"company_type":"Toolmaking","website_url":"https://www.protoshape.co.uk","location":"Linlithgow, West Lothian, Scotland, UK","certifications":null,"capabilities":["Injection Mould Toolmaking","Plastic Part Design","CNC Milling","Spark EDM","Overmoulding","Low-Volume Moulding","Rapid Prototyping"],"industries":["Industrial","Consumer Products","Medical"],"lead_time":null,"min_order":null,"employees":"1-9","established":2011,"materials":["P20 Tool Steel","Tooling Grade Aluminium"],"key_equipment":["Haas Machining Centres","Charmilles EDM Machines"],"data_source":"company_website","data_confidence":"high","last_verified":"2026-02"}', NULL, true, true, 'claimed');


